From: NWA50BE OpenWrt Project <noreply@invalid.example>
Subject: [PATCH] dropbear: backport 2026.90 and 2026.91 security fixes
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only

Carry OpenWrt 25.12 2218cb194946 and 6dead2869209 onto dropbear 2025.89:
the -t forced-command bypass, non-blocking authorized_keys open,
out-of-bounds close() fd, scp CVE-2019-6111 completion and CVE-2026-35385
setuid/setgid clearing, plus the 2026.91 scp regression fixes.

